\par
# 1. Executive Summary\par
\par
## Product Name\par
\par
**Hermes**\par
\par
## Product Category\par
\par
AI Manuscript Intelligence Studio\par
\par
---\par
\par
## Vision Statement\par
\par
Hermes is an AI-powered desktop writing environment designed to transform traditional manuscripts into intelligent, interactive creative systems.\par
\par
Unlike traditional writing software that only stores text, Hermes understands:\par
\par
* characters\par
* scenes\par
* relationships\par
* timelines\par
* themes\par
* revisions\par
* author preferences\par
\par
Hermes acts as an intelligent creative partner that helps authors write, edit, organize, analyze, and prepare manuscripts for publishing.\par
\par
---\par
\par
# 2. The Problem Hermes Solves\par
\par
Modern authors struggle with:\par
\par
## Manuscript Complexity\par
\par
Large manuscripts contain thousands of interconnected elements:\par
\par
* characters\par
* events\par
* locations\par
* motivations\par
* themes\par
* narrative arcs\par
\par
Traditional editors and word processors treat these as disconnected text.\par
\par
---\par
\par
## Revision Challenges\par
\par
Authors often lose track of:\par
\par
* why changes were made\par
* previous versions\par
* character consistency\par
* timeline errors\par
* repeated ideas\par
\par
---\par
\par
## AI Limitations\par
\par
Most AI writing tools:\par
\par
* only see the current prompt\par
* lack manuscript memory\par
* do not understand story structure\par
* do not preserve author ownership\par
\par
---\par
\par
